{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2104","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Numbers and Strings"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"3 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each integer $$$x$$$ from $$$1$$$ to $$$n$$$, we will form the string $$$S(x)$$$ according to the following rules:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" compute $$$(x+1)$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" write $$$x$$$ and $$$x+1$$$ next to each other in the decimal system without separators and leading zeros; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" in the resulting string, sort all digits in non-decreasing order. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, the string $$$S(139)$$$ is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"011349"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" (before sorting the digits, it is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"139140"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"). The string $$$S(99)$$$ is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"00199"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to count the number of distinct strings among $$$S(1), S(2), \\dots, S(n)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains one integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test case consists of one line containing a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 10^{9} - 2$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output a single integer — the number of distinct strings among $$$S(1), S(2), \\dots, S(n)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n42\n1337\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n42\n948\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"2104F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2104/problem/F"}